{"id":"mtk-a","title":"Bilangan, Pola, dan Bangun Datar","subject":"matematika","fase":["A"],"kelas":[1,2],"elemen":["Bilangan","Aljabar","Pengukuran","Geometri"],"packId":"mtk-a","summary":"Membilang sampai 100, puluhan dan satuan, menjumlah dan mengurang di garis bilangan, pola, bangun datar, dan membaca tabel.","objectives":["membaca dan menulis bilangan sampai 100 dengan puluhan dan satuan","menjumlah dan mengurang dengan bantuan garis bilangan","melanjutkan pola bilangan sederhana","mengenali segitiga, persegi, persegi panjang, dan lingkaran"],"sections":[{"id":"nilai-tempat","title":"Puluhan dan satuan","html":"\n      <p>Sepuluh satuan bisa diikat menjadi satu <b>puluhan</b>. Bilangan 47 artinya 4 ikat puluhan dan 7 satuan yang lepas.</p>\n      <figure class=\"lesson-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 224 190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"4 puluhan dan 7 satuan\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"34\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"62\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"76\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"90\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"104\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"118\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"132\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"146\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"20\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"34\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"48\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"62\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"76\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"90\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"104\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"118\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"132\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"146\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"20\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"34\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"48\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"62\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"76\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"90\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"104\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"118\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"132\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"146\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"20\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"34\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"48\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"62\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"76\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"90\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"104\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"118\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"132\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"146\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3d47c9\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"132\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c47a0e\"/><rect x=\"162\" y=\"132\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c47a0e\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"132\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c47a0e\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"114\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c47a0e\"/><rect x=\"162\" y=\"114\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c47a0e\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"114\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c47a0e\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"96\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c47a0e\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#3d47c9\">4 puluhan</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#c47a0e\">7 satuan</text></svg><figcaption>4 puluhan + 7 satuan = 47</figcaption></figure>\n      <div class=\"ingat\">Tempat angka menentukan nilainya. Pada 47, angka 4 bernilai 40, bukan 4. Itu sebabnya 12 lebih besar dari 9: angka 1 pada 12 bernilai sepuluh.</div>"},{"id":"tambah-kurang","title":"Menjumlah dan mengurang","html":"\n      <p>Menjumlah berarti <b>maju</b> di garis bilangan. Mengurang berarti <b>mundur</b>. Untuk 7 + 5, mulai di 7 lalu maju 5 langkah.</p>\n      <figure class=\"lesson-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Garis bilangan: dari 7 maju 3 ke 10, lalu maju 2 ke 12\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#3d47c9\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">0</text><line x1=\"65.71428571428572\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"65.71428571428572\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"65.71428571428572\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">1</text><line x1=\"101.42857142857143\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"101.42857142857143\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"101.42857142857143\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">2</text><line x1=\"137.14285714285714\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"137.14285714285714\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"137.14285714285714\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">3</text><line x1=\"172.85714285714286\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"172.85714285714286\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"172.85714285714286\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">4</text><line x1=\"208.57142857142858\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"208.57142857142858\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"208.57142857142858\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">5</text><line x1=\"244.28571428571428\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"244.28571428571428\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"244.28571428571428\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">6</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">7</text><line x1=\"315.7142857142857\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"315.7142857142857\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"315.7142857142857\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">8</text><line x1=\"351.42857142857144\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"351.42857142857144\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"351.42857142857144\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">9</text><line x1=\"387.14285714285717\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"387.14285714285717\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"387.14285714285717\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">10</text><line x1=\"422.85714285714283\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"422.85714285714283\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"422.85714285714283\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">11</text><line x1=\"458.57142857142856\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"458.57142857142856\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"458.57142857142856\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">12</text><line x1=\"494.2857142857143\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"494.2857142857143\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"494.2857142857143\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">13</text><line x1=\"530\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"530\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\"/><text x=\"530\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">14</text><path d=\"M280 84 Q333.57142857142856 40 387.14285714285717 84\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><text x=\"333.57142857142856\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#3d47c9\">+3</text><path d=\"M387.14285714285717 84 Q422.8571428571429 32 458.57142857142856 84\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><text x=\"422.8571428571429\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#3d47c9\">+2</text></svg></figure>\n      <p>Trik yang membantu: lompat ke 10 dulu. 7 + 3 = 10, lalu sisa 2 langkah lagi, jadi 12.</p>\n      <div class=\"contoh\"><span class=\"lbl\">Contoh</span><p>Dina punya 15 kelereng, memberi 6 kepada adiknya. 15 − 5 = 10, lalu 10 − 1 = 9. Sisa 9 kelereng.</p></div>"},{"id":"pola","title":"Pola bilangan","html":"\n      <p>Pola adalah aturan yang terus berulang. Cari tahu: bilangan berikutnya bertambah berapa, atau berkurang berapa?</p>\n      <div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Pola +3</span>2, 5, 8, 11, <b>14</b>, 17, ...</div>\n      <p>Penjumlahan berulang juga sebuah pola: 5 + 5 + 5 + 5 = 20. Nanti di kelas berikutnya ini disebut perkalian, 4 × 5.</p>"},{"id":"bangun","title":"Bangun datar","html":"\n      <figure class=\"lesson-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 150\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Segitiga, persegi, persegi panjang, dan lingkaran\"><path d=\"M60 20L110 120H10z\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">segitiga</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"30\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"195\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">persegi</text><rect x=\"280\" y=\"45\" width=\"130\" height=\"75\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">persegi panjang</text><circle cx=\"490\" cy=\"75\" r=\"47\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"490\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">lingkaran</text></svg></figure>\n      <p>Segitiga punya 3 sisi lurus. Persegi punya 4 sisi yang sama panjang. Persegi panjang punya 4 sisi, dua panjang dan dua pendek. Lingkaran tidak punya sisi lurus dan tidak punya sudut.</p>\n      <div class=\"ingat\">Coba cari di sekitarmu: jam dinding (lingkaran), ubin (persegi), pintu (persegi panjang), atap rumah dari samping (segitiga).</div>"},{"id":"data","title":"Membaca tabel","html":"\n      <p>Tabel membantu membandingkan. Kelas 2 mengumpulkan botol untuk didaur ulang:</p>\n      <table><tr><th>Hari</th><th>Senin</th><th>Selasa</th><th>Rabu</th></tr><tr><td>Botol</td><td>6</td><td>9</td><td>4</td></tr></table>\n      <p>Bilangan terbesar ada di hari Selasa. Jumlah semuanya 6 + 9 + 4 = 19 botol, yang tidak lagi mengotori sungai.</p>"}]}